  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Suzanne** (1 other source): Leonard Cohen cover, marked by the uploader as the first time Jim James performed it live [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Hide in Plain Sight**: rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Know Til Now**: rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n- **Dear One**: rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n- **Drums**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **The World's Smiling Now**: rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **True Nature**: rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n- **I'm Set Free**: rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n- **In the Moment**: rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **jj2016-11-26** (recommended): source not stated; 20 songs; 112 min [1]. Said about its sound: Recording starts poorly and deteriorates; a dying power-box battery and possibly a bad cable caused distortion, saturation and a distant sound [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **jj2016-11-26**: taped by Kelly Casey; transferred by Kelly Casey; source: From the Balcony slightly right of center SP-BMC-2 Binaural microphones on a hat while sitting > SP-SPSB-11 Battery Box > Tascam DR-100mkII > SDHC 16/44 [1]",
